Template: pympacds/bus-prefix
Type: string
Default: org.pympacds
Description: D-Bus bus name prefix for pympacds services
 The namespace prefix used by pympacds services on the D-Bus system bus.
 All services share this prefix to discover each other automatically.
 .
 This value is written to the D-Bus security policy so that services may
 claim names under this prefix. Change it only if you need to run multiple
 independent pympacds systems on the same host.
